flowchart LR
  A[Email or document] --> B[Text PDF / XLSX / CSV / MIME parser]
  B --> C[Structured fields]
  C --> D{Customer, invoice, reference and balance valid?}
  D -->|yes| E[Atomic sandbox ledger posting]
  D -->|no| F[Human review with evidence]
  F --> E
  E --> G[Audit history and notification receipt]
  C --> H[Fingerprint and reference deduplication]
  H -->|duplicate| I[Blocked without posting]
